  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#A9BDD6;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Our Services</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Radon Test Before Buying a House in Manitoba or Saskatchewan</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">A proper radon test runs at least 91 days, and most closings don't wait that long. Here's what a screening test can tell you during the sale, what it can't, and how to finish the job once you have the keys.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+12045550173" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (204) 555-0173</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a No-Obligation Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/service-3.webp" alt="Radon Test Before Buying a House in Manitoba or Saskatchewan" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
